      "message": "fix(multiaxis)!: align saved tilt tests with current cache law\n\nSet the clearance fixture basis explicitly. Regenerate the guide example under the v3 verification law. Keep old-project verdicts stale and isolate basis-only cache invalidation in the compatibility tests.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Project format 63 records the tilt frame basis. Version-62 readers refuse newly saved projects. Existing version-62 projects retain their legacy basis when opened.\n\nRefs #2133",
